{
  "id": "2CH.33",
  "number": "33",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Ngoma 33",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase yabaye umwami afise imyaka cumi n’ibiri, aganza imyaka mirongo itanu n’itanu ari i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase akora ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, agendera mu bizira vy’ubuyobe vyakorwa n’amahanga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarirukanye imbere y’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asubira kwubaka ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo, ku mataba y’imisozi, ivyo se Hezekiya yari yarasambuye; yongera kwubaka ibicaniro vya Bayali, ashinga n’inkingi za Ashera. Yunamira ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru arabisenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yubaka ibicaniro mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", iyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yaravuzeko ati: “Izina ryanje rizoba i Yerusalemu ibihe vyose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu rugo rwose rw’Ingoro y’Uhoraho ahubaka ibicaniro vy’ibinyenyeri vyose vyo kw’ijuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agera n’aho atanga abahungu biwe kw’ibimazi vyo guturirwa mu kiyaya ca Beni-Hinomu, agendera mu bupfumu n’amareba, akoresha abahamagara imizimu na ba kamenyi. Akora ibibi vyinshi mu nyonga z’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", bimutera kuraka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afata inkingi ya Ashera yabazishije, ayishira mu Ngoro, imwe Imana yari yabwiye Dawidi n’umuhungu wiwe Salomo iti: “Muri iyi Ngoro n’i Yerusalemu ni ho natoranije mu yindi miryango yose ya Isirayeli, ngo hitirirwe izina ryanje ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sinzosubira gutuma Abisirayeli bakura ikirenge hasi ngo bave mu gihugu nahaye ba sekuruza, nibitwararika gukora ivyo nabategetse vyose, bagakurikiza ivyagezwe vyanje vyose, amabwirizwa n’amategeko nabahaye ncishije ku musavyi wanje Mose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Manase azimiza Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu bose, bituma bakora ibibi birengeye ivy’amahanga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarahonereje imbere y’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aburira Manase n’abantu biwe, ariko ntibavyitaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abateza abakuru b’ingabo z’umwami w’i Ashuri, bafata Manase bamugira imbohe, bacisha igera mu zuru ryiwe, bamubohesha iminyororo y’ubutare bw’umwakaka, maze bamujana i Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abonye ko ari mu mubabaro mwinshi, arondera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yiwe, yicisha bugufi cane imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana ya ba sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atakambiye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", na we aterwa n’akagongwe yumva ugutakamba kwiwe; maze amugarukana i Yerusalemu no mu bwami bwiwe. Nuko Manase amenya ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ari Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y’ivyo aca yubaka uruzitiro rw’inyuma y’Igisagara ca Dawidi, mu burengero bw’umugezi Gihoni mu kiyaya, gushika kw’Irembo ry’Amafi, no kuzunguruka umusozi wa Ofeli; arongera arugira rurerure cane. Ashiraho abatwara ingabo mu bisagara vyose bizitijwe inzitiro vy’i Buyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuraho imana z’abanyamahanga, akuraho na ca gishushanyo mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", n’ibicaniro vyose yari yarubatse ku musozi w’Ingoro n’i Yerusalemu; abiterera inyuma y’igisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma asana igicaniro c’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " agitangirako ibimazi vy’ishimwe n’ibimazi vyo gukenguruka, aca abwira Abayuda ngo bakorere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana y’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko abantu bakomeza gutangira ibimazi ku bicaniro vyo ku mataba y’imisozi, mugabo babishikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yabo gusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyabaye ku ngoma ya Manase, harimwo n’isengesho yasenze Imana yiwe, amajambo aberekwa bamubwiye mw’izina ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana y’Abisirayeli, vyanditswe mu bitabu bidonda ivyagenda biraba ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isengesho ryiwe n’uburyo Imana yamugiriye ikigongwe kubera gutakamba kwiwe hamwe n’ibibi vyose yakoze, n’uguta ubwizigirwa, n’ahantu hose yubatse ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, akongera agashiramwo inkingi za Ashera n’ibigirwamana yunamira, vyose vyanditswe mu bitabu vy’aberekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Manase arapfa; ahamvya ba sekuruza ahambwa ku kirimba iwe. Amoni umuhungu wiwe amusubirira ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni yari afise imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri igihe yimikwa ngo abe umwami, aca aganza imyaka ibiri ari i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
