              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abona ko ari bibi mu nyonga ziwe, nk’uko se Manase yakoze. Amoni asenga kandi atanga ibimazi ku bigirwamana Manase yari yaracurishije. ",
